-The Test Pyramid for Mobile
-
-• Local unit tests run on the JVM in milliseconds: the wide base
-• Integration tests combine real components such as Room plus a repository
-• UI and end-to-end tests run on a device or emulator: few, slow, valuable
-• Source sets: src/test runs locally, src/androidTest runs on a device
-
-Layer                      Test Type           Source set                Speed
-Mappers, Validators        Local unit          src/test                  ms
-UseCases, ViewModels       Local unit + fakes  src/text                  ms
-Repository + Room          Integration         src/androidTest           100s of ms
-Retrofit + interceptors    Integration         src/test (MockWebServer)  ms
-Screens (Compose)          UI Test             src/androidTest           seconds
-Login to transfer journey  End to end          src/androidTest           10s of seconds
-
