-Taming Flaky Tests
-
-• Causes: timing, shared state, animations, real network, test order
-• Disable animations in testOptions for instrumented runs
-• Use Android Test Orchestrator to isolate each test in a fresh process
-• Quarantine flaky tests, then fix them; never ignore them silently
-
